  "compulsory_education": {
    "end_age": 17,
    "notes": "Ages 5 through 17 (A.C.A. 6-18-201). A child who has reached age 5 on or before the date established in A.C.A. 6-18-207 (August 1) is subject to compulsory attendance. Parents of children not yet 6 by August 1 may file a kindergarten waiver form with the local district to opt out of kindergarten for that year. A child who has received a high school diploma or equivalent is exempt.",
